{"id":2713,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>5月22日下午，我院在科艺苑学术报告厅举办华彩讲坛。本次讲坛由学院党委副书记李庆乐主持，邀请《领导科学》杂志编辑部主任、副编审李军领主讲，我院研一、研二全体学生和部分教师参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLz92aMN-ZL8-DMdm-DLmVknzlDnm--DUlCaMl-ZnlUYLm90gihFp2hmCIa0nSysnkybLkyDLRWVLmQkoRf7M7lbMmNsoll4LRCPL4lsU4TFUlr2oRf2LzTFLzCPMllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPoRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7185&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E7D90602E26B80D4E96979E3061357C9/AEF80F19/1615E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 534px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLz92aMN-ZL8-DMdm-DLmVknzlDnm--DUlCaMl-ZnlUYLm90gihFp2hmCIa0nSysnkybLkyDLRWVLmQkoRf7M7lbMmNsoll4LRCPL4lsU4TFUlr2oRf2LzTFLzCPMllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPoRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7185&e=.jpg\"></p><p>李主任指出一篇学术论文从构思到见刊主要分为选题、写作、发表三个核心环节。选题是论文成败的关键，需立足研究前沿、贴合期刊方向并结合自身积累；写作要兼顾思想创新与表达规范；发表则应注重期刊匹配和与编辑沟通的技巧。同时强调，论文写作须严格遵循《学术论文编写规则》，规范摘要、关键词、参考文献等要素。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozT2fMRGanRC8ndR9Pnmf2LllDUmL-YUzr7U8-DolLDLll0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybn1ysU1y8MRQ7M4NYMm7PUl7PM47DMmUbU4l8LR-DL8QFL7-ZozW2UlQFLz67M7CJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPoRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7185&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/19F7B446D792611AA1716649C540263F/0B892FAF/17D4F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 548px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozT2fMRGanRC8ndR9Pnmf2LllDUmL-YUzr7U8-DolLDLll0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybn1ysU1y8MRQ7M4NYMm7PUl7PM47DMmUbU4l8LR-DL8QFL7-ZozW2UlQFLz67M7CJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPoRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7185&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲坛立足数智时代学术发展要求，厘清论文写作与发表的核心逻辑，兼具理论高度与实践价值，为同学们提升学术创作水平、走好科研之路奠定了坚实基础。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLz92aMN-ZL8-DMdm-DLmVknzlDnm--DUlCaMl-ZnlUYLm90gihFp2hmCIa0nSysnkybLkyDLRWVLmQkoRf7M7lbMmNsoll4LRCPL4lsU4TFUlr2oRf2LzTFLzCPMllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vPoRlJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7185&e=.jpg"}